{"id":"d4505d236865c21c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code.md","title":"连续泛函的规范邻域码","display":"df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code — 连续泛函的规范邻域码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code","aliases":["72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code"],"display":"df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code — 连续泛函的规范邻域码","depends_on":["[[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.6, print426/PDF438; local canonical representation construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code — 连续泛函的规范邻域码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6bad767147d20671\" href=\"?note=6bad767147d20671\" title=\"72-df-baire-prefix-continuity\">72-df-baire-prefix-continuity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.6, print426/PDF438; local canonical representation construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConstCyl}\">\\(\\operatorname{ConstCyl}\\)</span> 与零延长取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6bad767147d20671\" href=\"?note=6bad767147d20671\" title=\"72-df-baire-prefix-continuity\">72-df-baire-prefix-continuity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_F(s):=\\begin{cases}F(\\widehat s)+1,&amp;0&lt;|s|\\land\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s),\\\\\n0,&amp;|s|=0\\lor\\neg\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma_F(s):=\\begin{cases}F(\\widehat s)+1,&amp;0&lt;|s|\\land\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s),\\\\\n0,&amp;|s|=0\\lor\\neg\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个分支穷尽且互斥；正值只表示该柱集上的输出已经确定。即使 F 为常函数，也在空串处保留零，与本书 K* 的额外根条件一致。柱集恒值的检验可以不可计算，因此此构造不是由任意连续泛函有效提取程序码的算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-baire-prefix-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"6bad767147d20671","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-baire-prefix-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"6bad767147d20671","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)$；$s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}$。$\\operatorname{ConstCyl}$ 与零延长取 [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConstCyl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma_F(s):=\\begin{cases}F(\\widehat s)+1,&0<|s|\\land\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s),\\\\\n0,&|s|=0\\lor\\neg\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s).\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1474,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-